# NO cost-rows-push line, deliberately: same reason as the tracker below — a
# stopped box has no cost.csv growing, and the enrollment test asks for the
# absence to be declared rather than silent.
# NO extra-usage tracker line, deliberately. The box is STOPPED (the operator,
