# said "do not collect". The set-equality test caught the half-applied change.
# If the box comes back, BOTH lines return together; that pairing is the whole
# point of asserting the two sets are equal.
# NO quota-poll line, deliberately, for the same reason: the account-routing
# poller has nothing to poll on a stopped box. It returns with the tracker.

